// The channel park (SL:coroutines A3c): it records the readiness word's
// negated address, its operand, in the park word and arms nothing, since a
// send or a close on the channel sets the word the executor reads.
// `channel_wait` is the lane's addition to `std.task`
// (compiler/tests/coro/README.md, "The lane").
import std.task.{channel_wait}

func main() {
    channel_wait(-4096)
}
